.593" end="21.192" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.593" end="18.085">Righ</span><span begin="18.325" end="18.568">teou</span><span begin="18.568" end="18.892">sly,</span> <span begin="18.892" end="19.381">it</span> <span begin="19.381" end="19.647">wipes</span> <span begin="19.647" end="20.175">out</span> <span begin="20.175" end="20.466">all</span> <span begin="20.466" end="20.700">of</span> <span begin="20.700" end="21.192">us</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">它将名正言顺地把我们的存在全都抹去</span></p><p begin="21.530" end="25.656" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.530" end="21.770">But</span> <span begin="21.770" end="22.237">I</span> <span begin="22.591" end="22.840">keep</span> <span begin="22.840" end="23.233">rising</span> <span begin="23.233" end="23.638">back</span> <span begin="23.638" end="24.394">from</span> <span begin="24.394" end="24.972">the</span> <span begin="24.972" end="25.656">dust</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就把它消化成力量 我们来一起操纵这世界</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="25.883" end="27.771"><span begin="25.883" end="26.144">(Again</span> <span begin="26.144" end="26.345">and</span> <span begin="26.345" end="26.891">again,</span> <span begin="26.891" end="27.207">again</span> <span begin="27.207" end="27.507">and</span> <span begin="27.507" end="27.771">again)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一遍又一遍</span></span></p><p begin="26.172" end="29.649" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.172" end="26.340">无</span><span begin="26.340" end="26.556">数</span><span begin="26.556" end="27.045">碎</span><span begin="27.045" end="27.550">片</span> <span begin="27.660" end="27.950">不</span><span begin="27.950" end="28.182">停</span><span begin="28.182" end="28.506">缠</span><span begin="28.506" end="28.740">绕</span><span begin="28.740" end="29.238">相</span><span begin="29.238" end="29.649">连</span></p><p begin="30.120" end="32.202" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.120" end="30.291">The</span> <span begin="30.291" end="30.453">sha</span><span begin="30.453" end="30.690">dows,</span> <span begin="30.690" end="30.876">they</span> <span begin="30.876" end="31.032">whi</span><span begin="31.032" end="31.233">sper</span> <span begin="31.233" end="31.428">in</span> <span begin="31.428" end="31.614">your</span> <span begin="31.614" end="32.202">head</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道那些阴影一直在你的脑海里窃窃私语</span></p><p begin="32.264" end="34.159" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.264" end="32.367">I</span> <span begin="32.367" end="32.543">let</span> <span begin="32.543" end="32.696">them</span> <span begin="32.696" end="32.915">linger,</span> <span begin="32.915" end="33.272">and</span> <span begin="33.272" end="33.466">you</span> <span begin="33.466" end="33.576">will</span> <span begin="33.576" end="33.835">like</span> <span begin="33.835" end="34.159">it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是我让他们不断萦绕 而你将会喜欢上这种感觉</span></p><p begin="34.367" end="36.135" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.367" end="34.515">You&apos;re</span> <span begin="34.515" end="34.713">tied</span> <span begin="34.713" end="34.902">on</span> <span begin="34.902" end="35.073">my</span> <span begin="35.073" end="35.286">strings</span> <span begin="35.286" end="35.466">like</span> <span begin="35.466" end="35.613">a</span> <span begin="35.613" end="35.853">pu</span><span begin="35.853" end="36.135">ppet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你早已被我玩弄于股掌之间 变成一只提线木偶</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="36.104" end="38.165"><span begin="36.104" end="36.386">(Before</span> <span begin="36.386" end="36.668">you</span> <span begin="36.668" end="37.169">even</span> <span begin="37.169" end="37.484">no</span><span begin="37.484" end="37.661">ti</span><span begin="37.661" end="38.165">ce)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你注意到之前</span></span></p><p begin="38.577" end="40.135" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.577" end="38.761">I</span> <span begin="38.761" end="38.899">made</span> <span begin="38.899" end="39.040">a</span> <span begin="39.040" end="39.412">deal</span> <span begin="39.412" end="39.649">with</span> <span begin="39.649" end="39.748">the</span> <span begin="39.748" end="40.135">demons</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已与恶魔做好交易</span></p><p begin="40.135" end="42.617" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.135" end="40.747">I</span> <span begin="40.747" end="41.133">crave</span> <span begin="41.133" end="41.257">the</span> <span begin="41.257" end="41.660">feel</span> <span begin="41.660" end="41.931">of</span> <span begin="41.931" end="42.167">true</span> <span begin="42.167" end="42.311">de</span><span begin="42.311" end="42.455">si</span><span begin="42.455" end="42.617">re</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">沦陷于邪恶欲望的触感</span></p><p begin="42.842" end="46.789" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.842" end="43.076">There&apos;s</span> <span begin="43.076" end="43.406">nothing</span> <span begin="43.406" end="43.871">real</span> <span begin="43.871" end="44.056">终</span><span begin="44.056" end="44.434">究</span><span begin="44.434" end="44.590">走</span><span begin="44.590" end="45.142">向</span><span begin="45.142" end="45.706">黑</span><span begin="45.706" end="46.789">暗</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">There&apos;s nothing real 终究走向黑暗</span></p><p begin="47.222" end="51.293" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.222" end="47.937">Listening</span> <span begin="48.353" end="48.434">to</span> <span begin="48.434" end="48.681">all</span> <span begin="48.681" end="48.905">your</span> <span begin="48.905" end="49.138">des</span><span begin="49.138" end="49.337">pe</span><span begin="49.337" end="49.949">ration,</span> <span begin="49.949" end="50.206">soun</span><span begin="50.206" end="50.408">ding</span> <span begin="50.408" end="50.768">like</span> <span begin="50.768" end="50.996">a</span> <span begin="50.996" end="51.293">song</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我醉心倾听 你的绝望谱成的美妙乐曲</span></p><p begin="51.541" end="55.500" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.541" end="51.696">Des</span><span begin="51.696" end="51.939">ti</span><span begin="51.939" end="52.479">ny</span> <span begin="52.479" end="52.617">is</span> <span begin="52.617" end="52.848">just</span> <span begin="52.848" end="53.055">my</span> <span begin="53.055" end="53.451">game,</span> <span begin="53.451" end="53.619">but</span> <span begin="53.619" end="53.715">is</span> <span begin="53.715" end="53.904">all</span> <span begin="53.904" end="54.078">you</span> <span begin="54.078" end="54.372">coun</span><span begin="54.372" end="54.666">ting</span> <span begin="54.666" end="54.992">on</span> <span begin="54.992" end="55.244">right</span> <span begin="55.244" end="55.500">now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">命运只是我掌中的游戏 可却是你现在唯一的依赖</span></p><p begin="55.700" end="56.447" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.700" end="56.024">Joining</span> <span begin="56.024" end="56.213">the</span> <span begin="56.213" end="56.447">game</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">加入这场游戏</span></p><p begin="56.783" end="57.596" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.783" end="57.217">Killing</span> <span begin="57.217" end="57.596">spree</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的棋子势不可挡</span></p><p begin="57.558" end="58.592" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.558" end="57.731">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="57.731" end="58.019">enjoying</span> <span begin="58.019" end="58.283">the</span> <span begin="58.283" end="58.592">game</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">主导这场游戏</span></p><p begin="58.980" end="1:00.316" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.980" end="59.175">So</span> <span begin="59.175" end="59.481">get</span> <span begin="59.481" end="59.775">ready,</span> <span begin="59.775" end="59.957">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="59.957" end="1:00.316">here</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以为我的到来做好准备吧</span></p><p begin="1:00.316" end="1:02.002" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.316" end="1:00.541">Get</span> <span begin="1:00.541" end="1:00.757">ready</span> <span begin="1:00.757" end="1:01.072">for</span> <span begin="1:01.072" end="1:01.393">it,</span> <span begin="1:01.393" end="1:01.660">for</span> <span begin="1:01.660" end="1:02.002">it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为其准备好</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:03.809" end="1:05.729"><span begin="1:03.809" end="1:03.948">(Again</span> <span begin="1:03.948" end="1:04.125">and</span> <span begin="1:04.125" end="1:04.672">again,</span> <span begin="1:04.672" end="1:04.967">again</span> <span begin="1:04.967" end="1:05.189">and</span> <span begin="1:05.189" end="1:05.729">again)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一遍又一遍</span></span></p><p begin="1:06.340" end="1:10.177" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.340" end="1:07.261">Take</span> <span begin="1:07.261" end="1:07.551">my</span> <span begin="1:07.551" end="1:07.837">hand,</span> <span begin="1:07.837" end="1:08.079">let&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:08.079" end="1:08.487">set</span> <span begin="1:08.487" end="1:08.977">this</span> <span begin="1:08.977" end="1:09.414">world</span> <span begin="1:09.414" end="1:09.669">on</span> <span begin="1:09.669" end="1:10.177">fire</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">把手交给我 我们把这世界付之一炬</span></p><p begin="1:10.639" end="1:14.397" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.639" end="1:11.457">Light</span> <span begin="1:11.457" end="1:11.712">it</span> <span begin="1:11.712" end="1:12.216">up</span><span begin="1:12.216" end="1:12.633">-up</span> <span begin="1:12.633" end="1:13.027">for</span> <span begin="1:13.027" end="1:13.264">the</span> <span begin="1:13.264" end="1:14.397">show</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将它点燃 为了我的精彩演出</span></p><p begin="1:14.794" end="1:18.319" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.794" end="1:15.540">Pain</span> <span begin="1:15.540" end="1:15.730">will</span> <span begin="1:15.730" end="1:16.087">get</span> <span begin="1:16.087" end="1:16.375">to</span> <span begin="1:16.375" end="1:16.951">you</span> <span begin="1:16.951" end="1:17.230">when</span> <span begin="1:17.230" end="1:17.451">the</span> <span begin="1:17.451" end="1:17.899">night</span> <span begin="1:17.899" end="1:18.319">arrives</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每当黑暗渐渐降临 痛苦就会无休无止地追赶你</span></p><p begin="1:18.499" end="1:20.539" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.499" end="1:18.687">Like</span> <span begin="1:18.687" end="1:18.814">the</span> <span begin="1:18.814" end="1:19.075">hunter</span> <span begin="1:19.075" end="1:19.471">when</span> <span begin="1:19.471" end="1:19.606">a</span> <span begin="1:19.606" end="1:20.176">prey</span> <span begin="1:20.176" end="1:20.539">lies</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像看到一只躺着的猎物时的捕食者</span></p><p begin="1:20.642" end="1:22.745" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.642" end="1:20.783">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:20.783" end="1:21.209">just</span> <span begin="1:21.209" end="1:21.638">how</span> <span begin="1:21.638" end="1:21.851">the</span> <span begin="1:21.851" end="1:22.322">world&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:22.322" end="1:22.745">like</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">弱肉强食 适者生存 这个世界的规则罢了</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:23.370" end="1:25.290"><span begin="1:23.370" end="1:23.517">(Da</span><span begin="1:23.517" end="1:23.613">-da</span><span begin="1:23.613" end="1:23.841">-da</span><span begin="1:23.841" end="1:24.402">-da,</span> <span begin="1:24.402" end="